---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title={"Ketua Umum — TIDAR"} description={"Biodata Rahayu Saraswati Dhirakanya Djojohadikusumo, B.Sc."} bodyClass={"inner-page leader-page logo-page"} extraCss={["/pages.css"]}>
<main id="main"><section aria-labelledby="mlHeroTitle" class="ml-hero">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-shape">
<svg focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="none" viewbox="0 0 1600 560">
<defs>
<lineargradient id="mlHeroRedGradient" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="#ef101c"></stop>
<stop offset="0.48" stop-color="#e20d19"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="#c80712"></stop>
</lineargradient>
<pattern height="22" id="mlHeroDotPattern" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="22">
<circle cx="3" cy="3" fill="#ffffff" fill-opacity="0.14" r="1.7"></circle>
</pattern>
</defs>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-red" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroRedGradient)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-dots" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroDotPattern)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-edge" d="M1145 0C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560" fill="none"></path>
</svg>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-ribbons"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-dots"></div>
<div class="ml-hero-inner">
<div class="ml-hero-copy">
<p class="ml-eyebrow">Profil Pimpinan</p>
<h1 class="ml-hero-title" id="mlHeroTitle"><span>Ketua</span><span>Umum</span></h1>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-rule"></div>
<p class="ml-hero-lead">Biodata, pengalaman, dan kontribusi pimpinan Pengurus Pusat TIDAR.</p>
</div>
<figure class="ml-garuda-panel">
<img alt="Garuda Pancasila, lambang negara Republik Indonesia" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1042" src="/assets/garuda-pancasila-authentic.webp" width="960"/>
<figcaption class="ml-garuda-caption"><span>Lambang Negara</span><span>Republik Indonesia</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</section><section class="content-section content-section--paper"><div class="container leader-profile leader-profile--premium"><div class="leader-photo"><img alt="Rahayu Saraswati Dhirakanya Djojohadikusumo, B.Sc." decoding="async" loading="eager" src="/assets/rahayu-saraswati.png"/><div class="leader-badge"><span>Pengurus Pusat TIDAR</span><strong>Ketua Umum PP TIDAR</strong></div></div><div class="leader-copy"><p class="section-kicker">Profil Pimpinan</p><h2>Rahayu Saraswati Dhirakanya Djojohadikusumo, B.Sc.</h2><div aria-label="Biodata singkat" class="leader-bio-summary"><span></span><p>Rahayu Saraswati merupakan Ketua Umum TIDAR dan Wakil Ketua Komisi VII DPR RI. Ia aktif memperjuangkan pemberdayaan generasi muda, kesetaraan, pengembangan UMKM, ekonomi kreatif, dan pariwisata Indonesia.</p></div><div class="bio-facts"><div class="bio-fact"><small>Tempat, tanggal lahir</small><strong>27 Januari 1986, Jakarta</strong></div><div class="bio-fact"><small>Pendidikan formal</small><strong>Sarjana Sains, Purdue University Global (2021)</strong></div></div><section aria-label="Lebih dekat dengan profil pimpinan" class="leader-fun-facts">
<header><p class="section-kicker">Lebih Dekat</p></header>
<div class="fun-fact-grid"><article class="fun-fact-card"><span aria-hidden="true" class="fun-fact-icon">★</span><div><p>Rahayu Saraswati menyelesaikan pendidikan Sarjana Sains di Purdue University Global pada 2021.</p><a href="https://mpr.go.id/detailAnggotaPDF/3389" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Sumber: MPR RI <svg aria-hidden="true" class="external-arrow" focusable="false" viewbox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 12 12 4M6 4h6v6"></path></svg></a></div></article><article class="fun-fact-card"><span aria-hidden="true" class="fun-fact-icon">★</span><div><p>Riwayat resminya mencatat pengalaman memimpin jaringan anti-perdagangan orang serta mendirikan Yayasan Parinama Astha.</p><a href="https://mpr.go.id/detailAnggotaPDF/3389" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Sumber: MPR RI <svg aria-hidden="true" class="external-arrow" focusable="false" viewbox="0 0 16 16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M4 12 12 4M6 4h6v6"></path></svg></a></div></article></div>
</section></div></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
